{"ref":"BDB, חֲרֹדִי","hw":"חֲרֹדִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרֹדִי</span></big>  <strong>adj.loc.</strong> only c. art. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַח׳</span>, of Harod <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:25\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.25\">2 S 23:25a</a> (v. Dr and <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:1\" href=\"/Judges.7.1\">Ju 7:1</a>); = <span dir=\"rtl\">הַהֲרוֹרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:27\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.27\">1 Ch 11:27</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">הַהֲרוֹדִי</span>); also <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 23:25\" href=\"/I_Samuel.23.25\">1 S 23:25b</a> but prob. not genuine; not in 𝔊 or <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11\">1 Ch 11</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27\">27</a> (v. Dr and <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֱלִיקָא\" href=\"/BDB,_אֱלִיקָא\", dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִיקָא</a> supr. p. 45 b).","next":"BDB, חֲרָדָה","prev":"BDB, חֲרֹד"}